    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements .<br />Statement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> : In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Cu</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> bonds are present.</p><p>Statement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math> : In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>, ligands coordinating with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced></math> &nbsp;ion are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>-and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>-based ligands.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
